=== 6.3 Realistic constraint
<realistic-constraint>
#emph[Lead-bhasma research faces unique constraints]: - Many
jurisdictions prohibit any lead-containing supplement preparation - Even
research use requires specific licensing - IRB approval for human
studies is essentially impossible for lead-containing preparations -
Animal studies face significant regulatory scrutiny - Potential funders
are wary of lead research due to public health concerns

These constraints mean that lead is the dhatu where empirical validation
work is #emph[least] tractable, despite the chemistry being
scientifically interesting. The framework’s predictions about lead
remain mostly hypothetical.

